# Cloudflare Pages redirects. https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Clean URLs (/style-guide -> /style-guide/index.html) work automatically,
# so nothing is required here yet.
#
# If a tool ever switches from ?f= to path-based assets
# (e.g. /style-guide/bantay loading a set client-side), add an SPA fallback
# so unknown subpaths serve the tool shell instead of 404ing:
#
#   /style-guide/*  /style-guide/index.html  200

# --- fastenaiting.com custom domain -----------------------------------------
# fastenaiting.com is added as a Cloudflare Pages custom domain on this same
# project. Route bare visits (fastenaiting.com/) into the /fastenaiting/ tool
# so it feels like a single-purpose site instead of a subpath.
https://fastenaiting.com/  /fastenaiting/  302
https://www.fastenaiting.com/  /fastenaiting/  302
